    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is a digital interface given form. It may resemble a virtual pet, a video game character, a digital assistant, or any other form that exists within your holopad. Given form, your eidolon most resembles hardlight constructs and can similarly adept at causing interference with other tech beings.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> Arcane</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> construct, eidolon, tech</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> the Universe</p><hr /><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Small</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> sword (slashing), jaws (piercing), advert (bludgeoning)</p><p><strong>Eidolon Attributes</strong> <em>Con</em> +1, <em>Int</em> +2, <em>Wis</em> -1, <em>Cha</em> +1</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Arcana, Computers</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> one common language</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 25 feet</p><hr /><p><strong>Initial (1st) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.3VQy9ZLZaSgoNQMP]{Digital Form}</strong></p><p><strong>Symbiosis (7th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.8hqhKp3g6t4rRMLF]{Digitized Countermeasures}</strong></p><p><strong>Transcendence (17th) @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.su-eidolons.Item.Fr2yEBPa9aHOyIcQ]{Technomatic Mastery}</strong></p><p><em>Starfinder 2e content.</em> Computers is a Starfinder skill; in a Pathfinder-only game it is tracked as a Computers Lore skill.</p><hr /><p>The summoner's half of this eidolon is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-sovereign.summons-unleashed.Item.GfryKT38rIAvSNPK]{Program Eidolon} in the Summons Unleashed compendium.</p>"
